			"Message": "chore(Maintain): Expand CHANGELOG to Keep a Changelog format\n\nUpdate Maintain/CHANGELOG.md from a minimal \"Initial version\" entry to a comprehensive changelog documenting all releases from v0.0.1 (2024 Q2) through v0.6.0 (2026 Q2).\n\nThe expanded changelog now includes: CI/CD pipeline establishment, GritQL infrastructure, Node.js sidecar support, build tool releases, guard disarm mechanism, and documentation updates - all following the Keep a Changelog format with proper semantic versioning and quarterly release cycle documentation.",
			"SHA": "4f73f645b80156b6b90be3cbed16ba24dec50d52"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-16T20:52:21Z",
			"File": [
				"⣿⣿⠇⠀⠀",
				28,
				13
			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Coordinate Element submodule updates across all components\n\nSynchronize 13 Element submodules to their latest commits with the following changes:\n\n**Documentation & Changelogs:**\n- Air: Populate CHANGELOG with complete version history v0.0-v0.3\n- Common: Add ProviderType enum variants (Task, Authentication, TreeView, SourceControl, DebugAdapter), convert to Keep a Changelog format\n- Echo: Expand CHANGELOG with comprehensive version history\n- Mountain: Split WindServiceHandlers/CocoonService into 39 atomic domain modules, add CHANGELOG\n- Output: Update CHANGELOG with v0.0-v0.5 history\n- Rest: Convert CHANGELOG to Keep a Changelog format\n- Sky: Document v0.0-v2.1 full changelog\n- Worker: Document complete changelog v0.0.1-v0.5.0\n\n**Dependency Updates:**\n- Common: Bump actions/cache, @cloudflare/workers-types\n- Echo: Bump wrangler, miniflare, @cloudflare/workers-types, cloudflare/wrangler-action\n- Grove: Bump actions/cache\n- Maintain: Bump actions/cache\n- Sky: Bump @xterm/*, astro, dotenv\n\n**Features & Refactoring:**\n- Mountain: Major IPC refactor into domain-specific modules (Command, Configuration, FileSystem, etc.)\n- Wind: Add 5 Tauri event subscriptions (fileChange, onDidChangeConfiguration, onTerminalData, onWillShutdown, onDidChangePhase)\n\nThis coordinated update ensures all components are synchronized with latest features, dependency updates, and documentation improvements.",
			"SHA": "b74f161014606eddda1e0a773e47349e893fd9e9"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-16T12:49:37Z",
			"File": [
				"⠇⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				28,
				2
			],
			"Message": "fix(Project): Synchronize Cocoon and Mountain gRPC interface fixes\n\nCoordinate submodule updates to address bidirectional communication issues:\n\n1. **Cocoon**: Fix executeCommand request field name from `args` to `arguments` to match Mountain backend interface. Improve $acceptModelAdded handler to properly parse DocumentStateDTO: use URI.toString() for proper URI formatting, handle content as Lines array or direct string, and simplify content length calculation.\n\n2. **Mountain**: Fix registerCommand handler to properly lock CommandRegistry before insertion and use correct CommandHandler::Proxied structure with SideCarIdentifier/CommandIdentifier fields. Fix provider registration to use self.RunTime.Environment instead of self.Environment.\n\nThese changes ensure correct gRPC communication between Cocoon extension host and Mountain backend, proper command routing, and reliable document state synchronization.",
			"SHA": "0052731481d3c5cdeab783e23bf4dccf241d8db6"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-16T12:45:02Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				28,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Mountain): Add serde_json::json macro import to MountainVinegRPCService\n\nAdd serde_json::json macro to the imports in MountainVinegRPCService to enable JSON construction for gRPC message handling. This supports building structured JSON payloads for the Vine protocol service layer.",
			"SHA": "ad4e95c0f1fc66068350e847e17d4d7e1b30ba63"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-16T12:44:46Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				28,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Mountain): Handle extension registration notifications from Cocoon\n\nAdd three new notification handlers in MountainVinegRPCService to process messages from the Cocoon extension host:\n1. **window.showMessage**: Forward info/warn/error messages from extensions to the Sky UI layer via `sky://notification/show` Tauri event\n2. **registerCommand**: Store proxied extension commands in CommandRegistry with \"cocoon-main\" sidecar identifier, enabling Wind to route command execution back to Cocoon\n3. **Provider registration fallback**: Handle provider registration via the vscode API shim path (register_hover_provider, register_completion_item_provider, etc.) as a fallback for providers registered outside the typed RPC path\n\nThese handlers enable proper bidirectional communication between extensions running in Cocoon and the Mountain/Sky layers, completing the extension registration flow.",
			"SHA": "2a84003ca655e5474e91b38b583dff1ac856ee0f"
		}
	],
